      "text": "Frontier drug discovery programs require frontier capabilities.  Today, we\u2019re excited to share that BMS will be using Chai\u2019s models to support the discovery of new therapeutics. Since rolling out Chai-3 to partners at the start of this year, we\u2019ve partnered with @EliLillyandCo, @Novartis, @Pfizer, @argenxglobal, and now @BMSnews. Many of the world\u2019s leading biopharma companies are now using our models to go after diseases.\n\nScientific discovery is the domain where access to frontier AI matters the most. At @ChaiDiscovery, we\u2019ve seen first hand how our latest model generations can make the difference between discovering a molecule and not. We\u2019re excited to work with @BMSnews to break new ground in medicine and science.",
